      "value": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KEhy9rM7pBY\n\nI just saw this video and agreed with it.\nIt says ranking is not good for players, because it enables players to \"judge\" person only by their color of nametag, and sometimes it might discourage communication.\n\nIn my opinion, ranking between players are not suitable for this kind of \"social\" communication game, because it is difficult to fairly define \"rank\" of people, even in real world. But I also want to support newcomer, so it might be good to know who are new user.",
